        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="0793" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg709"/>

                <head>No. 329.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jackson to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 3, 1886</date>.
                        (Received August 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 283.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose, herewith, copy
                    and translation of Mr. Mariscal’s reply to my note of 30th ultimo, relating to
                    the case of Francisco Arresures, an American citizen shot near Piedras Negras. A
                    copy of my note was inclosed in my No. 280, of 30th ultimo.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>HENRY R. JACKSON.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d333-a1.xml" xpointer="d333-a1"/>
            </div>
